stylized_female_body.blend

The stylized female body and its two eye objects from the Blender Studio "Human Base Meshes"
asset bundle, version 1.4.1, with everything else in the bundle removed.

Source: https://download.blender.org/demo/asset-bundles/human-base-meshes/human-base-meshes-bundle-v1.4.1.zip
Page: https://www.blender.org/download/demo-files/ (Asset Bundles, Human Base Meshes)

